{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The heat shrink tubing assortment feels useful for small workshop repairs and complements my recent electronics fastener kit without requiring one exact repair in mind.",
    "The solder seal connectors connect with my interest in practical repair supplies, although I would wait for an actual wire-splicing need before choosing them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The hose fittings and ring terminals require specific sizes and projects that my recent purchases do not establish a need for.",
    "Examination gloves, testing supplies, trash bags and concrete sealant do not follow my current interest in hardware and workshop organization; the bulk glue also exceeds my occasional repair needs."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat workshop hardware purchases as interest in almost any industrial or maintenance supply.",
    "Buying fastener assortments seems to have been taken as a reason to recommend other multipacks, even when their quantities or specialized uses do not fit my needs."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent magnetic hooks and fastener kits suggest an interest in organizing, securing and assembling things, which makes useful complements more appealing than unrelated supplies.",
    "I rarely choose something without a clear use: a flexible repair assortment can appeal to me, while size-specific parts and large consumable quantities need a concrete project."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognize my practical workshop interests but stretch them into supplies for projects and quantities I have no current need for."
}"}
